50000          ! number of rays    
500            ! number of sample particles    
1.0d-4         ! Minimum relative flux    
50             ! Max internal chord    
50             ! Max external chord    
90             ! number of scattering angle bins    
1.0            ! Refractive index of the medium   
1.5            ! Mantle: Particle refractive index (real)
1.0E-5         ! Mantle: Particle refractive index (imag)
1.88           ! Core: Particle refractive index (real)
0.01           ! Core: Particle refractive index (imag)
0              ! seed for random number generation    
0.200          ! Wavelength
200.0d0        ! Outer radius (in micrometers)    
20.0d0         ! Inner radius (in micrometers)  
1              ! Identification number for run
0              ! External medium: 1=yes  
0              ! Internal medium: 1=yes    
0.097          ! External medium: single-scattering albedo
1.0d0          ! Internal medium: single-scattering albedo    
1.19           ! External medium: mean free path (in micrometers)
1.0d0          ! Internal medium: mean free path   
60             ! Number of phase matrix angular points    
1000           ! Number of points in random number array    
256            ! Number of G-L integration points for cosine map    
0.2            ! Relative standard deviation of radius    
4.0            ! Power law index for C_3 correlation    
10             ! Maximum degree in C_1, C_2, C_3    
24             ! Number of rows in an octant    
test3-         ! Prefix for the output file names
